From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:13:30 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add sign-in through a system Google account (Google Play
 Services / microG)

A system account is stored as a pseudo refresh token gms:<hex account name>.
YouTubeSignInService asks the account manager for an access token instead of
exchanging a refresh token via OAuth. The device-code flow is unchanged.

